&lt;li&gt;Swap &lt;code&gt;BUTTERFLY_SPRITES&lt;/code&gt; for your own ASCII art frames&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tune &lt;code&gt;flap_speed&lt;/code&gt; per state for different animation feels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  Final Thoughts
